<a name="basic"/><h1>Basic Configuration</h1>

<p>The minimal example in <a href="quickstart.html#quick">Quick Start</a> may be sufficient for many use cases, but SQL Relay has many configuration options.  For a production deployment, you will alomst certainly want to configure it further.</p>

